{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2022-05-31 16:00:00', 'title': "DUPONT TO PARTICIPATE AT DEUTSCHE BANK'S 13TH ANNUAL GLOBAL MATERIALS CONFERENCE", 'text': "WILMINGTON, DEL. , MAY 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ED BREEN, EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF DUPONT, AND LORI KOCH, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF DUPONT, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT DEUTSCHE BANK'S 13TH ANNUAL GLOBAL MATERIALS CONFERENCE IN NEW YORK ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 8 TH FROM 8:15 A.M."}